#                                                                              #
#   Satellite information                             > %%%%%%%%%%%% <  > %%% <# PTH_SATELL EXT_SATELL
#   Satellite macro model (ORBGEN)                    > %%%%%%%%%%%% <  > %%% <# PTH_PLATDEF EXT_PLATDEF
#   Satellite/station problem file                    > %%%%%%%%%%%% <  > %%% <# PTH_SATCRUX EXT_SATCRUX
#                                                                              #
#   SLR frequency information                         > %%%%%%%%%%%% <  > %%% <# PTH_FRQ EXT_FRQ
