# BEGIN_PANEL NO_CONDITION #####################################################
# MENU_EXT 2.1: Campaign Data, Orbit and EOP Files                             #
#                                                  campaign                    #
# ORBIT FILES                                      directory   extension       #
#   Precise orbits (original)                     > %%%%%% <                   # DIR_OPR
#   Precise orbits                                > %%%%%% <    > %%% <        # DIR_PRE EXT_PRE
#   Standard orbits                               > %%%%%% <    > %%% <        # DIR_STD EXT_STD
#   Radiation pressure coefficients               > %%%%%% <    > %%% <        # DIR_RPR EXT_RPR
#   Improved orbit elements                       > %%%%%% <    > %%% <        # DIR_ELE EXT_ELE
#   ORBEX file (for attitude reporting)           > %%%%%% <    > %%% <        # DIR_OBX EXT_OBX
#   Earth orientation parameters                  > %%%%%% <    > %%% <        # DIR_ERP EXT_ERP
#   Earth orientation parameters (IERS format)    > %%%%%% <    > %%% <        # DIR_IEP EXT_IEP
#   Geocenter coordinates                         > %%%%%% <    > %%% <        # DIR_GCC EXT_GCC
#   Satellite/Receiver clocks                     > %%%%%% <    > %%% <        # DIR_CLK EXT_CLK
#   Differential code biases                      > %%%%%% <    > %%% <        # DIR_DCB EXT_DCB
#   Observable-specific biases                    > %%%%%% <    > %%% <        # DIR_OSB EXT_OSB
